{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35618","headline":"又代孔明哭先主 · 李山甫","name":"又代孔明哭先主","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鲸鬣翻腾四海波，始将天意用干戈。\n尽驱神鬼随鞭策，全罩英雄入网罗。\n提劒尚残吴郡国，垂衣犹欠魏山河。\n鼎湖无路追仙驾，空使羣臣泣血多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35618.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35618","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}